Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.34,0:00:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的人数增长之快 远远超过预料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our numbers have grown beyond wildest expectation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.44,0:00:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是凛冬将至\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And winter will soon be upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.93,0:00:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,如此乱局 元老院已经力不从心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Resources of the Senate are drained by these conflicts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.11,0:00:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is one among us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,可以自掏腰包支援前线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who could fund endeavor from his own purse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.81,0:00:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,要养这么庞大的军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It would take considerable coin and effort{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.74,0:00:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,财力精力可不少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to raise such a force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.84,0:00:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,作为回报 你可以有指挥权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in return you will be offered a command,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,位次当然在科西尼斯和费尤瑞斯之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}under Cossinius and Furius, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.22,0:00:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我有点后悔当初离开温柔的海风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I begin to question turning from the calm of the ocean breeze,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,还有希留爱沙山城墙的庇护了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the safety of my city's walls in Sinuessa en Valle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.85,0:00:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我同意他们的条件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Their terms are agreeable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 这个人身上有信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus, this one carried a message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.28,0:00:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是您计划好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You planned this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.41,0:00:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这上面说 望此消息能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It speaks of hope that word finds them safe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.40,0:00:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,安全抵达宅邸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}within the villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.72,0:00:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,剿灭斯巴达克斯的大任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sole command and charge to bring Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.28,0:00:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,全仰仗你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to deserved end is now yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.34,0:00:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,没有哪座宅子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There isn't a villa in all the land{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.02,0:00:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,能容纳这么多人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that could hold such numbers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.85,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,的确没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, there is not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.45,0:00:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,要有一座城才能容纳我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only a city could hold us now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：诅咒者之战》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.47,0:01:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,《兵临城下》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.07,0:01:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这可没有屠马那么容易 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not as easy as butchering a horse, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.09,0:01:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,它们那一踢可温柔多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Their kick is considerably more gentle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.77,0:01:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,迪欧特莫斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Diotimus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.58,0:01:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯召见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus summons you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.99,0:02:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,南部海岸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The southern coast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.91,0:02:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这就迫使克拉苏要找到我们 必须远道行军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will force Crassus' army to march much greater distance to meet us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.26,0:02:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,耗尽他们的体力和物资\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sapping strength and supplies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.96,0:02:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,可等我们到那里也只剩一口气了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But will we not stand as drained at journey's end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.26,0:02:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们拿下城池便可以恢复元气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The comfort of city walls will see us revived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉苏没有这优势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing denied Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.83,0:02:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,迪欧特莫斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Diotimus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.37,0:02:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我想听听你的建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have your counsel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.60,0:02:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.86,0:02:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我对战略战术一无所知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am absent knowledge concerning strategies of war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.75,0:02:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不过有的事情你很熟悉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet you are well versed in other needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你提到过一座有城墙庇护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You spoke of a city protected by walls{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.36,0:02:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,海风吹拂的城池\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and caressed by ocean's breeze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.03,0:02:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,希留爱沙山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah...Sinuessa en Valle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.89,0:02:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我在那里住了很多年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Uh, home to me for many years...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.67,0:02:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那你一定很清楚那儿的防御体系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then you know of its defenses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.39,0:02:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你想夺下那座城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would take the city?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.59,0:03:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,至于怎么夺 要看你怎么说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mmm, that path rests upon your words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.84,0:03:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,有两道城门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are two gates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.55,0:03:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,主城门朝西 正对着山陵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The main one faces the hills to the west.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,白天为贸易往来而开门 日落后便封闭起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Open for trade during light of day, secured as sun retires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.24,0:03:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,另一道呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.36,0:03:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,倚悬崖而建\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Set against cliffs,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.21,0:03:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,直通往米利亚峰的峡谷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}running up to the canyons of Melia Ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.84,0:03:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,冬天无法通行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Impassable during winter months,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.10,0:03:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,现在山顶已经入冬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which are already upon its peak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.71,0:03:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不希望大家困在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not find ourselves trapped there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.08,0:03:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.79,0:03:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,主城门怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How stands the main gate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.24,0:03:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦封闭 坚不可摧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Formidable, once sealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.85,0:03:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,几个人偷偷摸进去 可以趁夜打开城门吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Could a few men from within see it opened, beneath cover of night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.48,0:03:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,城门戒备森严 而且你们也没有机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is well defended, and you would be absent means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.25,0:03:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,市政官担心有人拿武器对付卫兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Aedile feared weapons could be turned upon the guards,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.88,0:03:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,因此凡搜到的兵器都锁在城门旁的储物室内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}ordered all of note locked within a storeroom near the gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.24,0:03:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,进城不能带武器吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must give up sword upon entering?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.99,0:04:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,还是换个更可行的目标吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us turn toward more favorable prospect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.26,0:04:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold a moment...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.01,0:04:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我旅行时和一个人打过交道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had dealings with a man during my travels,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.19,0:04:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他说他就来自那座城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who claimed the city his own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.12,0:04:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,埃提斯 他是铁匠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Attius, a blacksmith by trade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.06,0:04:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.53,0:04:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我主人经常说很讨厌这家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My dominus often spoke of his distaste for the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.77,0:04:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能相信罗马人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can we lay trust in the Roman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.09,0:04:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是有个罗马名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He stands Roman only by name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,只要给他足够多的钱币\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Weigh his purse with enough coin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.11,0:04:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,管你是色雷斯人还是高卢人 有奶便是娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and he would call Thrace or Gaul his mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.44,0:04:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那么你跟我一起去同他交涉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have you with me to break word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.20,0:04:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我也去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would join you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.70,0:04:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,动身出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Break camp and follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.68,0:04:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,埋伏好 听我号令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remain unseen until called to purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.69,0:04:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你的烙印怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of your brands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.70,0:04:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,如果进城时被搜身 那努力就白费了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you are searched at the gate, effort will be short lived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.41,0:04:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A point well made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.33,0:04:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我那该死的主人对市政官颇有影响力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My fucking dominus holds sway with the Aedile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.91,0:04:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,就说你要找洛厄斯做买卖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Speak the name of Laurus towards meeting of trade,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.23,0:05:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定能挡开麻烦事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}stand chance of avoiding entanglement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.97,0:05:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,下一次你见到他 就轮到洛厄斯跪下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The next you greet him, it will be Laurus who kneels...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.78,0:05:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,管你叫主人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and calls you master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.27,0:05:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,往前走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Step forward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.45,0:05:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,可以了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That will do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.25,0:05:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,交出武器 有武器吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give up weapons. Any weapons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.44,0:05:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,往前走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Step forward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.66,0:05:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,到希留爱沙山做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}State business within Sinuessa en Valle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.95,0:05:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,做粮食买卖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We come for grain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.23,0:05:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,再就是看你们这儿有什么乐子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And all the pleasures your city has to offer...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.71,0:05:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是侮辱我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah...you insult me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这么一点儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By so light a palm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,请接受我沉沉的歉意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well...allow weighted apology...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.72,0:05:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你的镯子 还有上面的珠宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have your brace, and the jewels upon it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.41,0:05:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我身上最珍贵的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is most treasured possession at this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.64,0:06:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不能交给别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not part with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.18,0:06:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那就他妈的别想进城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then turn from fucking gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.80,0:06:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,来人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Guards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.63,0:06:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,如您所愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.69,0:06:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,请转告洛厄斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, please inform Laurus that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.54,0:06:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他的客人没办法赴约了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}his guests will not be able to keep intended meeting, hmmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.74,0:06:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,交出武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, give over weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.94,0:06:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他美言几句 说德修斯招待得很周全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And grace ear of the man that Decimus saw you well treated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.65,0:06:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.89,0:06:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证到时候你有奖赏可拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall see you well rewarded this day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.28,0:06:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你的困难 乌尔比安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I understand your plight, Ulpianus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.67,0:06:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,可你也要理解我夫君啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but you must understand my husband's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.71,0:06:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,西利西亚的瘟疫污染了我们的水源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Cilicians yet plague our waters{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯又袭击我们的陆地运输\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and Spartacus now assaults transport upon land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.50,0:06:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,粮食的价格…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The cost of grain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.50,0:06:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,高得太离谱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}soars beyond reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.75,0:06:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我为了弥补损失 给面包涨价的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I raise the price of my bread any further to cover loss,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.84,0:06:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,民众恐怕饶不了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I-I fear the crowd will turn upon me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.57,0:07:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这事交给我夫君处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A matter to be taken up with my husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.57,0:07:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,莱塔 我这么要求不只因为利润\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not ask if profit were my only concern, Laeta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.84,0:07:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我妻子怀孕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My wife is with child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你说两句吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will broach subject with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.81,0:07:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 别谢太早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Gratitude. - Hold sentiment until it is deserved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.82,0:07:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不指望他心软\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not expect him to be moved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.89,0:07:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,三个第纳尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Three denarii!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.91,0:07:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 今早的新鲜货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, fresh this morning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.65,0:07:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你提到的那人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is the one you spoke of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 市政官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is, Aedile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.29,0:07:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,自从迪欧特莫斯逃跑后 我不就说过吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I warned you shackle would not stand warning enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.70,0:07:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,镣铐的威慑力不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}after Diotimus slipped from grasp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.49,0:07:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Words now heeded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.27,0:07:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,处死他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.22,0:07:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,完事后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in grim wake,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.50,0:07:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,贴出告示 以儆效尤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}post notice to quell further unpleasantness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.75,0:07:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,站起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stand up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.46,0:07:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,快过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.05,0:07:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,恩尼乌斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ennius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.87,0:08:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么不去粮仓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why are you not at the horreum?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.26,0:08:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,让乌尔比安的事情耽搁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was delayed by young Ulpianus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.59,0:08:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他恳请我跟你说… - 现在不是时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- He has implored me to broach - Now is place nor time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.23,0:08:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on, get on with it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.65,0:08:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,受尊敬的市政官大人许可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By permission of honored Aedile,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我向各位说明 又有一个奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I present yet another beloved slave{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.68,0:08:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,因大逆不道的思想和图谋叛乱的言行而堕落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}fallen to treacherous thought and whisper of rebellion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.52,0:08:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,摊上这么个恶毒的主 谁能不反\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And who would not fall to such beneath heel of a toad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.88,0:08:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,有人发现他私藏食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was discovered secreting scraps of food{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.51,0:08:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,打算离开本城 远走高飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}intended for journey far from these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.16,0:08:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,家狗发疯 这不能怪洛厄斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Laurus cannot be faulted for a dog turned to madness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,善待动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Show an animal kindness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.84,0:08:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,它们便绝对忠诚于你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and it will give loyalty until the heavens fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.15,0:08:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他打算投奔亲人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A journey that would lead to kinship{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.69,0:08:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,只是鞭打它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Show it nothing but the lash{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,跟那些意图不轨 叛国作乱的人鬼混\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with like mind of untold mischief towards the Republic...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.20,0:08:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那就难怪它们龇牙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and wonder not why it bears teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.54,0:08:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,只用镣铐根本就没有什么威慑力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shackles alone no longer offer fair deterrent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.13,0:08:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,必须加上石头以示警醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us add to them with warning of weighted stone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.33,0:08:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,让胆敢有这种念头的人知道 这是死路一条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the promise of death for any who dare follow in such regard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.75,0:09:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,站住 听好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop, and listen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.41,0:09:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,让他尝尝苦头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make him suffer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.96,0:09:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉这混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Finish that fucker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.87,0:09:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要想办法阻止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Must make attempt to end this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.51,0:09:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们就跟他一个下场了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It would but pair our fate with his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.92,0:09:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那人命悬一线 我不能袖手旁观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not stand idle while the man's life holds in the balance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.53,0:09:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.09,0:09:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.31,0:09:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.60,0:09:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他一定会把你该死的共和国打得血肉横飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will see your fucking Republic to blood and shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.85,0:09:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.39,0:09:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.44,0:09:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 斯巴达克斯 - 要他的脏嘴再也说不出话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Spartacus! - See rebellious tongue forever stilled!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.84,0:09:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.37,0:09:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.37,0:09:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,等斯巴达克斯把你们统统送进地狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With Spartacus sent you all to afterlife!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.47,0:09:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,快来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.33,0:09:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,扔啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Throw!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.17,0:09:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,扔啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Throw!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.23,0:09:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,报应的时刻到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is your time for retribution!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.35,0:09:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.86,0:09:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,继续扔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Throw more!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.56,0:10:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好样的 去死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah! Die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.24,0:10:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.45,0:10:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,快来啊 扔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on, throw!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.43,0:10:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你引起他们注意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You draw attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.75,0:10:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮他早些了断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I but end suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.09,0:10:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我要同样对待那些遭受罗马荼毒的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I would for all so afflicted by festering disease of Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.13,0:10:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,每个百人团指派一名号令官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Procure a cornicen for each centuria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,打仗时要确保我的命令清晰无误地传达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have command obscured during battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.97,0:10:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,传令官增加三倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And see tesserarius tripled in number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.85,0:10:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,如果斯巴达克斯发动夜袭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watch must be alert should Spartacus attack{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.91,0:11:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,必须及时通报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}under cover of darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.42,0:11:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不能像科西尼斯和费尤瑞斯那样措手不及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not be caught unawares as Cossinius and Furius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,梅泰勒斯元老又来信了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Another message from Senator Metellus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.21,0:11:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他这是要拿羊皮纸压死我们吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The man threatens to bury us beneath a storm of parchment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.95,0:11:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,元老院等不及要我们军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Senate grows anxious for our troops to move{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,离开战神广场 追捕斯巴达克斯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from Field of Mars in pursuit of Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.23,0:11:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不只他们这么急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are not alone in such thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.23,0:11:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不过还有事情没办完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mmm, there are yet needs to be attended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.76,0:11:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,武器装备方面怎么样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How stand we on account of arma?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,萨比努斯和我按要求置备齐了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sabinus and I have procured what was requested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.47,0:11:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,您一定会满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will be well pleased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.91,0:11:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那就掂量掂量你的成果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us weigh the worth of your labor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.46,0:11:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,再考虑你的回报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}set achievement to scale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.02,0:11:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经超出他的预期了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have exceeded expectation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.13,0:11:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定能看到你的价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will recognize value of all your efforts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.47,0:11:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你最有资格成为仅次于他的指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And who most deserves highest command beneath him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.66,0:11:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,锻造之神都打不出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vulcan himself could not have forged{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.21,0:11:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,更高贵更精良的武器了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}more glorious arma towards noble cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.86,0:11:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,确实罕见 你这锻造的技巧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a rare thing... for such blasphemy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.57,0:12:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,配得上这渎神的言论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to be proven in execution of skill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.53,0:12:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,承蒙克拉苏赞赏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I stand humbled by the praise of Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.99,0:12:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,直说吧 你要价多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A straighten back, and see words follow towards honest price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.71,0:12:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,九十第纳尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ninety denarii.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.21,0:12:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,最低价格了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My-my finest offering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.21,0:12:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,稍差一些的价格呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And cost of less divine spectacle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.06,0:12:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,士兵的全套装备只要一百二十第纳尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One hundred and twenty denarii per soldier, fully equipped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.68,0:12:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,您儿子已经同意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As agreed upon by your noble son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.25,0:12:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,价格很公道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A fair price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.03,0:12:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.79,0:12:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has arrived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.05,0:12:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你的条件可以接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your terms are agreeable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.90,0:12:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就由提比略代我完成这笔交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tiberius will conclude our business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.67,0:12:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, of course, gratitude{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.82,0:12:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我没说错吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did I not tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.63,0:12:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不用担心你应有的头衔了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There now stands nothing between you and deserved title.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.43,0:13:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我他妈的要在这儿耗一整天吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Am I to be kept waiting entire fucking day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.22,0:13:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这要决定于我的夫君\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If that is my husband's wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.70,0:13:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那他便要失望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, one he shall not see granted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.83,0:13:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,恺撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Caesar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.62,0:13:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你的下人忘了自己的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your men forget themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.24,0:13:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,失去理智的人是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are the one that has lost mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.89,0:13:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,退下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.25,0:13:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,她向来不喜欢我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She never did care for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.91,0:13:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,她有什么理由喜欢你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you ever given her reason?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没把她当女神膜拜是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My apologies for not worshipping her as Juno upon cloud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.71,0:13:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我只哄自己的妻子 好久没见到她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would fall to my own wife, too long from my arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,已经派人告诉科妮莉亚 说你推迟抵达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cornelia has been sent word of your delay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.15,0:13:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,推迟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Delay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.79,0:14:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我一路风尘仆仆赶过来 连澡都没顾得上洗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that what you term setting upon me as I return through city gate,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,匆匆忙忙进了城 你就这么说我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in advance of bath or fresh robe to erase hard journey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.06,0:14:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我说是必要的推迟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I term it necessity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.39,0:14:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都知道你在国外打了胜仗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your victories abroad are well known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.89,0:14:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你的独断专行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As is your insolence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.23,0:14:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不等地方总督许可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in waging battle against the allies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.33,0:14:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,与米特拉达梯的盟军大战一场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of Mithridates absent proconsuls' permission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.67,0:14:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,要是傻等那群糊涂蛋的指令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The province would have been lost{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.05,0:14:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,行省早就被夺走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if I had waited on word from those sodden fools.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,正如我要是等着你来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, as I would've lost advantage of lone voice upon ear,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.01,0:14:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿就没我说话的地方了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if I had waited to break word with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.97,0:14:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,有话直说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Speak plainly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.45,0:14:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌绕弯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I grow tired of mystery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,敞开天窗说亮话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, then let us part veil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.20,0:14:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你有恺撒家族的尊荣名号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You hold revered name of the Julian clan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.40,0:14:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,继承了维纳斯的血脉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sired from the bloodline of Venus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.53,0:14:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,她是埃涅阿斯的圣母 尊贵的罗马缔造者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Divine mother of Aeneas, forbearer of Romulus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.70,0:14:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,罗穆卢斯的先祖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}exalted founder of Rome{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.34,0:14:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我那该死的家世背景不用你来教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I require no lesson in my fucking heritage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.88,0:15:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那么就说说我的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then perhaps one in mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.67,0:15:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是神明的后代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am descendant from no god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.55,0:15:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有显赫的头衔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor man of lofty note.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.04,0:15:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,元老院之所以有我一席之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm tolerated within the Senate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.77,0:15:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,完全是因为我积累的雄厚财力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}solely for the wealth I have amassed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.97,0:15:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的劳动所得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}through labor and dealings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.97,0:15:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是踩着那些有贵族血统的人爬上来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}those with "Proper" Lineage deem beneath them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.86,0:15:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为这是他们讨厌你的唯一原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you believe this singular cause why they hate you, hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.64,0:15:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟米特拉达梯的战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your campaign against Mithridates{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.18,0:15:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,以及别的那些行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and um other adventures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.98,0:15:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,很烧钱 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Costly, were they not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.53,0:15:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你现在债台高累\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know you stand in considerable debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.70,0:15:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一群"糊涂蛋"视你为眼中钉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A dangerous place for a man to find himself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,恨不得除之而后快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when he's made enemies of the "Sodden fools"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.13,0:15:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你的处境可不妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who would see him to ruin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.40,0:15:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我会还清债务的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, I shall see it repaid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.77,0:15:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么还\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By what means?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.07,0:15:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你有头衔却没有财富\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You possess name absent wealth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.47,0:16:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你有财富却没有头衔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you possess wealth absent name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.99,0:16:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,如果克拉苏和恺撒联手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Imagine what could be wrested from highest perch,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,何愁大事不成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}were Crassus and Caesar to align themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.54,0:16:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我自打出娘胎起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My name has remained constant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.93,0:16:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,就背负起这名号了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}since falling from my mother's womb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.51,0:16:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你腰缠万贯也有这么多年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have been heavy with gold for equal years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.27,0:16:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,为何现在提出联手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why now suggest the pairing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.98,0:16:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,因为攫取功名利禄的大好机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Opportunity to seize laurels and the gratitude{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.94,0:16:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,摆到我们面前来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the Republic presents itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.72,0:16:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住机会 我们以后还能攫取更大的功名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And with it, first stone upon the road to greater glories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.35,0:16:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那我要怎么帮助你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What would you have me aid you in,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.95,0:16:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,才能早日看到这一天呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to see such a day hastened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.89,0:16:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,平息奴隶叛乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bring end to slave rebellion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.79,0:16:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,杀死斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And death of Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.34,0:17:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,埃提斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Attius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.42,0:17:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我找你有事 你这坏小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have words, you fucking goat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jupiter fuck me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.43,0:17:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗 怎么到这里来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you lost wit coming here, you mad shit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.73,0:17:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在是罗马公敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are branded an enemy of Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.52,0:17:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说你对共和国没什么好感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was told you hold no love for the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.82,0:17:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,别告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me you have not brought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.19,0:17:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你把携屎尿之使者带到我家里来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the Bringer of Fucking Piss and Shit to my very door?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.18,0:17:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你是威名远扬啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your legend precedes you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.16,0:17:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我带来的是机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I bring but opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.45,0:17:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你说不定可以大赚一笔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One that you may profit greatly from,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.12,0:17:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you are of a mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.30,0:17:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那利润必须非常可观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It would have to be very considerable,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.02,0:17:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,抵得上我受牵连的危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to outweigh risk of association dragging me to depths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.92,0:17:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,该有的自然会有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A river shall flow in its wake,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.42,0:17:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我们达到了想要的目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if we find ourselves lighted upon favorable shore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.86,0:17:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你们冒险进来是为了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What would such a journey require?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你的本行 锻造兵器的技术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your skill, towards the fashioning of swords.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.82,0:17:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,兵器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Swords?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.42,0:17:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的市政官不准我锻造武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The fucking Aedile denies me the crafting of weapons,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.59,0:18:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,怕被你们这些造反的拿去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}blame laid on fear of your rebellion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.13,0:18:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,现在只准打造工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All that is struck now are fucking{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.42,0:18:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,还有镣铐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}tools and shackles,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.92,0:18:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好让那些该死的权贵们控制奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to keep the slaves of those privileged fucks in hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.95,0:18:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不用管市政官怎么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Aedile will not be of concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.78,0:18:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你们需要多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How many would you need?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.38,0:18:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,两把剑就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two will see our needs met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.96,0:18:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你们给的钱可远远不止买两把剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You give coin enough for many times what you ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.38,0:18:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,多的钱随你处置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The balance towards your discretion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.59,0:18:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你们到底要干什么 搞得神秘兮兮的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what purpose will silent tongue not speak of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.63,0:18:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,同意还是不同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do we have agreement?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.90,0:18:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,两把剑 然后我们各不相干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two swords, and an end to involvement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.77,0:18:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,日落时来拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Return as sun falls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.89,0:18:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我留在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would linger,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.01,0:18:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,跟这位可信的朋友叙叙旧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and recall joyous times with trusted friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.79,0:19:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我不放心这个罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hold concern for the Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.21,0:19:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,希望那些钱足够让他乖乖办事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us hope the weight of coin anchors him to purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.64,0:19:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他没这个狗胆呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What if coward done more to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.58,0:19:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那他肯定被石头砸死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall see him dash upon rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.81,0:19:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,去跟艾力冈会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rejoin Agron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.89,0:19:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,做好准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make preparations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.95,0:19:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,月到中天 城门便会升起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When moon is at its highest, we shall see gate raised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.70,0:19:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这座城的劫数便要到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And fucking city fall to deserved fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.95,0:19:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,埃提斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Attius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.33,0:19:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我的胃口变大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My appetite swells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.34,0:19:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,希留爱沙的城里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where would I find holdings of grain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.97,0:19:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,哪儿有粮仓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}within Sinuessa's walls?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.52,0:19:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,质量上乘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The finest quality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.53,0:19:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,来自西西里岛的麦田\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From the fields of Sicilia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.11,0:19:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我有意大量购买\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have mind towards large acquisition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.25,0:19:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你印上吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, I'll seal that for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.92,0:19:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.42,0:20:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,要等我夫君决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My husband concludes business...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.17,0:20:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,反正我白天也没有什么要紧事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No pressing concern until moon greets night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.76,0:20:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的储量很足嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You stand well supplied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.04,0:20:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,今天刚从西西里岛运来一船货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shipment received this day from Sicilia,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.33,0:20:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,初一还有货运过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with another to arrive upon the Kalends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.22,0:20:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不过大部分都由克拉苏收购了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Although most of that has already been purchased by Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,马科斯•克拉苏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Marcus Crassus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.36,0:20:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的商铺是他最中意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He favors our stores above all others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.51,0:20:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,而且因为斯巴达克斯的叛乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And one of the few that can yet afford cost,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.89,0:20:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,开销与日俱增 能承担的商铺也没几家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}ever rising in light of events concerning the rebel Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.26,0:20:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我在旅途中也有所耳闻 他带来的麻烦不小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have heard of the distress he has caused the Republic, in my travels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.82,0:20:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你来希留爱沙山是为什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What brings you to Sinuessa en Valle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.93,0:20:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.93,0:20:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我身边的奴隶不断增多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I find myself with ever expanding family of them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.66,0:20:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,希望保证他们吃饱穿暖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and would ensure they are well provided for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.58,0:20:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算让他们住在城里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have thought toward housing them in the city?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.96,0:20:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,有这样想过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It has crossed mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.64,0:20:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你希望他们过上舒服日子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you wish to see them any form of comfort,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.03,0:20:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我劝你打消这个念头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would strike from such.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.07,0:20:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到有个奴隶在市场上被砸死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I witnessed a slave stoned in the marketplace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.14,0:20:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,很常见吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A common occurrence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.44,0:20:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.58,0:21:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但恐怕以后就常见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I fear it will become so,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.69,0:21:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,如果叛乱的事情不能很快解决的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if this matter of rebellion is not soon concluded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.90,0:21:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们祈祷吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us pray, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.53,0:21:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,希望有个好的结局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For the proper end to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.99,0:21:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他终于忙完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He at last frees himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.19,0:21:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你今早在现场观刑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were at the stoning this morning, were you not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.67,0:21:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我参与了一起不幸的事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was present at unfortunate spectacle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.29,0:21:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,然后早早地结束了刑罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And ended it prematurely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.40,0:21:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.60,0:21:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,人们的情绪几近疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The crowd pressed towards frenzy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.13,0:21:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再看到无谓的流血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not see more blood spilled absent cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.44,0:21:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.86,0:21:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不要无谓的流血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Absent cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.96,0:22:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,拿刀替我修面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bring knife to bear upon beard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.15,0:22:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不听从指令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why do you pause in the face of command?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.46,0:22:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,她只不过听从更高的指令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She but obeys a higher one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.43,0:22:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,主人命令你不得修面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The dominus orders you to remain unshorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.93,0:22:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,为了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Toward what purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.64,0:22:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他的想法只有他本人知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His thoughts are his own in such regard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.05,0:22:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那你的呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what are yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.82,0:22:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.07,0:22:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个很简单的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a simple question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.48,0:22:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么想的呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are your thoughts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.85,0:22:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,想什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Towards what subject?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.29,0:22:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,站在你面前的这个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The one that stands before you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.57,0:22:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为恺撒这人怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do you gauge Caesar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.79,0:22:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我不认识他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not know him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.74,0:22:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,说不出有用的观点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and can form no opinion of worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.43,0:22:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,无论问什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Demand any question,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.38,0:22:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他都会如实相告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and he shall break answer to aid you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.92,0:22:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是有妇之夫吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are taken with wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.76,0:23:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你的眼睛很像我妻子的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your eyes stand as my wife's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.02,0:23:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,唇齿的味道也是一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As does taste upon lips.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.34,0:23:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,温柔的抚摸能让我想起她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would be reminded of her in shadow's touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.40,0:23:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛闭上便没什么不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eyes shut towards difference...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.36,0:23:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,让热切的记忆温暖我的身心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and warmed by longing remembrance...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.09,0:23:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,克芮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.94,0:23:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remove yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.54,0:23:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.06,0:23:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你送来了好酒与美人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You send gift of wine and warm embrace,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.26,0:23:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,却又抢走…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}only to snatch away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.15,0:23:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,她不是用来满足你的兽欲的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was not sent for your fucking pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.86,0:24:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.04,0:24:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为那女人无足轻重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did not know the girl held meaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.43,0:24:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你在外征战太久 放荡惯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've been away too long from civilized company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.00,0:24:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,穿好袍子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See yourself to robe,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.66,0:24:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,把心思放到更要紧的事情上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and thoughts towards more pressing matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.56,0:24:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你向他袒胸露乳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You present yourself with breasts and ass{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.30,0:24:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,尽显曼妙身姿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}formed with morning dew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.42,0:24:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他这样欲火旺盛的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it wonder that a man strong of desire{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.13,0:24:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,当然蠢蠢欲动 想要尝尝鲜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would not be tempted to taste such ripe offering?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.57,0:24:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,吸取教训 给我滚出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take lesson and remove yourself from fucking sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.52,0:24:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命 女主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.98,0:24:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还没有足够的马匹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have not yet procured enough horses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.02,0:24:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我不希望看到骑兵在关键时刻不够用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not have cavalry found lacking in moment of need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.31,0:24:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What has happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.71,0:24:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么事 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing of concern, apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.32,0:24:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,说出来 我给你做主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Break words, and find comfort in how they are received.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.63,0:24:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚才奉命伺候恺撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was attending Caesar as commanded...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.29,0:24:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,恺撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Caesar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.27,0:24:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,盖乌斯•尤利乌斯•恺撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gaius Julius Caesar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.20,0:25:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他对我动手动脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He laid hands upon me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.25,0:25:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是你父亲出现 我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If your father had not appeared, I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.44,0:25:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.63,0:25:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们所追捕的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The man we hunt...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.61,0:25:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,曾是竞技场的冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was a champion at the arena,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.11,0:25:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,作战的本事不逊于任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to rival any in the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.97,0:25:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他再厉害 也就是个角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet only a gladiator, regardless of skill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.47,0:25:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他是如何击败罗马军团的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How has he bested our legions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.89,0:25:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯熟知战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus knows of war,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.07,0:25:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,从他在色雷斯的时候起就开始征战了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the waging of it from his days in Thrace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.90,0:25:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,如果传言是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If rumor is true,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.31,0:25:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,格雷博那个蠢货在死于维苏威一役之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he fought among the auxiliary beneath the fool Glaber{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.98,0:25:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯在他的辅军中战斗过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before his fall of Vesuvius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.06,0:25:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说他对我们的战术也很熟悉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then he's familiar with our tactics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.88,0:25:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,并且利用这些知识 摧毁那些曾压迫他的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And has used such knowledge to the regret of those that have pressed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.92,0:25:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他自以为熟悉罗马战士的套路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He believes he knows what a "Proper" Roman soldier will do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.17,0:25:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以利用这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing that could be turned toward advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.47,0:25:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望我的孩子有这样的头脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would that my own blood stood now so sharp of mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.52,0:25:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,多经历战火的淬炼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, years and the taste of battle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.84,0:25:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你那乖乖狗自然能牙尖爪利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will hone your pup's teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.52,0:25:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这点我倒从不怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of that I have little doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.69,0:26:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但要击败斯巴达克斯 我需要不是狗而是狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet to bring Spartacus to ground I must have a wolf at my side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.96,0:26:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们便在月圆之夜亮出尖牙 仰天长嗥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And let us turn gleaming fang towards moon of full purpose,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.93,0:26:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,杀他个血肉横飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and see blood and gore matted upon fur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.09,0:26:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,宵禁 不准外出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Curfew! Inside please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.83,0:26:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,全都进屋子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make your way indoors!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.09,0:26:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,宵禁 快走快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Curfew! Move, move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.33,0:26:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move along!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.32,0:26:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不准在街上逗留\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Off the streets!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.40,0:26:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,快离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You move along!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.48,0:26:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,街上不准留人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Clear these streets!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.78,0:26:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,梅莎莉娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Messalina!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.67,0:26:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这孩子就是喜欢胡闹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She has a habit of running wild.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.25,0:26:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.90,0:26:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不要离开你母亲身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You stay close to your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.91,0:26:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.05,0:26:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,快进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.12,0:27:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.49,0:27:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,今天早上在广场我就注意你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I laid eyes upon you in the square this morning,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.99,0:27:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是你吧 - 彼此彼此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- did I not? - As I upon you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.34,0:27:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,听说你早上在城门口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Word has reached ear you spoke my name{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.18,0:27:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,搬出我的名号 说是要找我有事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}upon entering gate, claiming business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.66,0:27:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕你是搞错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear you have been misled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.68,0:27:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你还不值得我浪费时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have nothing I find of worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.59,0:27:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那你进城是为了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then why are you within these walls?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.25,0:27:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,松手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remove hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.57,0:27:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is your purpose here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.40,0:27:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你去问我夫君 自然就有答案了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Put question to honored husband, and have reply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.42,0:27:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他和市政官做生意吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He trades with the Aedile?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.74,0:27:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.88,0:27:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是我误会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The mistake is mine, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.01,0:27:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,天黑后不要到处乱晃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See yourself from the streets before nightfall,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.15,0:27:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不要让我再误会你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to avoid further misunderstanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.87,0:27:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come along!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.96,0:28:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.32,0:28:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,并不是城里的每个人都像他这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I assure you, not all in the city stand as him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.32,0:28:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他说要我别到处乱晃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What he spoke of, removing myself from the streets...?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.32,0:28:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,很讨厌吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it not troublesome?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.34,0:28:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我也劝过我夫君\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I made attempt to dissuade my husband,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.63,0:28:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但他觉得在彻底平叛之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but he thought it best to have streets cleared{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.57,0:28:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,最好是清空街道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of all but city guard,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.75,0:28:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,只留下卫兵巡逻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until the rebellion has been quelled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.90,0:28:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你有地方过夜吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have a place to call your own this night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.97,0:28:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.69,0:28:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我正要过去呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have my eye towards such.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.98,0:28:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,都进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move inside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.48,0:28:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,清空所有街道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All streets are to be cleared!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.91,0:28:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,宵禁开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Curfew is in affect!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.51,0:28:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,加强戒备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A little more securer this time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.19,0:29:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,卫兵清空了街道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The streets cleared by guards?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.04,0:29:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是市政官的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By command of the Aedile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.96,0:29:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you know of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.27,0:29:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,去你妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fuck yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.83,0:29:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我又不比别人多知道什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}News greets me with shared ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.55,0:29:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,相信能满足你们的要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Trust these will service need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.65,0:29:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.78,0:29:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我们现在还有要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet there is more we must ask of you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.38,0:29:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought as much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.84,0:29:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,两百第纳尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two hundred denarii a piece,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.18,0:29:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以在这里过夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you may lay hidden here until sun crests{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.12,0:29:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,直到解除宵禁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and curfew is lifted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.39,0:29:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我没打算过夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is not sleep we seek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.63,0:29:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我脑子抽风了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What deformity of mind do you think I suffer from,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.94,0:29:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,还要继续跟罗马公敌合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I would give further aid to enemies of Rome?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.89,0:29:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你对共和国又没什么感情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You hold no love of the republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.17,0:29:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,酒灌多了吧 你也多愁善感起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sentiment often through wine so in years past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.65,0:29:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,至少我有吃有喝 有别人羡慕的特权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Words of the drunk and food, jealous of privilege.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.25,0:29:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正巧钱多得使不完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We find ourselves heavy with Roman coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.09,0:30:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你开个价吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What cost would sober intent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.95,0:30:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,五千第纳尔应该足够我离开这座城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Five thousand denarii would see me far from this city,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.96,0:30:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,离开天杀的罗马了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and shores of fucking Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.87,0:30:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A bargain well struck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.74,0:30:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,老子不再是罗马人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Call me Roman no more, then!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.83,0:30:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你要多少剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How many more swords do you need?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.10,0:30:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,足够装备那些加入我们的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Those that join us are well armed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.51,0:30:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,加入你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Join you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.70,0:30:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你们想要攻占这座城吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You move to take the fucking city?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.76,0:30:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是解放它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We move to liberate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.47,0:30:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一阻挡我们的是城门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gate stands only in our path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.59,0:30:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们本打算趁夜偷袭 打开城门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We would to slit throats in the night and see it raised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.70,0:30:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,却没预料到宵禁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unexpected curfew presents difficulty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.93,0:30:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这就很难隐秘行动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in reaching it unnoticed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.78,0:30:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,卫兵看到我们就会大叫大喊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}City guard would raise clamor well in advance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.77,0:30:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这我可帮不上忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot aid you in this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.63,0:30:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,小命都保不住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It would mean my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.36,0:31:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经亲手为斯巴达克斯打了一把剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have forged weapons for Spartacus himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.40,0:31:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,只要他们发现我们手中拿着你的剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we are discovered with your craft clutched in hand,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.57,0:31:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟不跟我们干也都是一个死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then they will send you to the afterlife all the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.44,0:31:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,操他妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fuck the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.69,0:31:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What would you have of me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.94,0:31:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,轻一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.54,0:31:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,别笨手笨脚的弄坏了里面的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should not have content fall to ruin by rough use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.14,0:31:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,把剩下的都搬过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go fetch the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.93,0:31:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,要他们搬的时候当心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See that they are careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.65,0:31:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这些不必要的东西可都是我行军的累赘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would see me weighted with unnecessary comforts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.05,0:31:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我有那么重吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have I grown that heavy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.02,0:31:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These are yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.10,0:31:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,如果战事拖太久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not be found wanting,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.88,0:31:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不希望独守空房 害你空想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if campaign stretches beyond expectation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.10,0:31:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你想随我去跟斯巴达克斯打仗吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You wish to join me, in pursuit of Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.81,0:32:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish no such thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.83,0:32:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但我更不想几个月甚至几年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I will not be removed from your arms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.90,0:32:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不在你身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for months threatening years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.93,0:32:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,普布利乌斯和我要陪你和提比略一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Publius and I shall travel with you and Tiberius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.53,0:32:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道军营里是不能有女人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know women are forbidden within encampment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.41,0:32:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但没有规定女人不能进侍从营地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet they are not banned from followers' camp,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.87,0:32:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,除非我连规矩改了都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}unless rules have shifted absent knowledge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.28,0:32:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我不允许家人睡在奴隶和妓女当中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have my family bedded among slaves and whores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.62,0:32:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,即便如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it not better solution{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.14,0:32:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,也好过留他们在千里之外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than having them stricken from embrace?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.32,0:32:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你的心意我领了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Desire much appreciated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.47,0:32:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但如此靠近敌人 我必会分神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I could not stay mind from thought of your safety,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.91,0:32:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,担忧你的安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}placed so near the enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.12,0:32:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你留在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have you remain here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.62,0:32:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,远离随时能取人性命的战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}far from the threat of death war so often promises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.20,0:32:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,只是这样吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that sole reason?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.32,0:32:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.39,0:32:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,一切已就绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All has been attended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.88,0:33:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,您的军队已准备好 天亮就启程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your army stands ready to march upon first light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.60,0:33:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}News well received.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.43,0:33:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有话说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.45,0:33:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一的问题就是我的头衔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There yet lingers issue of what title I shall hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.79,0:33:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在考虑这样的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am possessed of leanings towards the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.78,0:33:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,日出时分自有定论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Morning sun shall see them fall to place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.90,0:33:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,把这些东西都放回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have these returned from where they sprang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.60,0:33:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我出发之前 要看到这里井然有序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have house in order before we take leave from it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.59,0:33:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为荣耀的职位只属于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought honored position all but mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.99,0:33:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,现在恐怕他另有人选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now I fear he favors another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.88,0:33:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那你跟母亲一样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then you stand as your mother,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.58,0:33:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,只有血缘维系 却是无足轻重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}bound by blood and inconsiderate worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.24,0:33:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,非常精美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a thing of rare beauty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.01,0:33:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.76,0:34:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.95,0:34:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,您征讨斯巴达克斯时会佩带吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will carry it when you face Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.70,0:34:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我要带父亲的剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall carry my father's sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.65,0:34:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然没有这把剑精美绝伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is not as well bred or considered as this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.40,0:34:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,却有更深的意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yet it holds deeper meaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.08,0:34:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那么由恺撒佩带吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Caesar will carry it then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.84,0:34:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,代您行使权力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As your word and will?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.29,0:34:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我不该让你离他这么近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should not have placed you within his reach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.70,0:34:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他的原始欲望很强烈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is a man of base needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.39,0:34:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那为何给他的头衔 高过您的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then why honor him with title, that above your son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.25,0:34:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我冒犯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies, I overstep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.62,0:34:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是说出了心里话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You speak your heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.21,0:34:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你关心那小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know your concern for the boy.{\r}
