Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.58,0:34:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望我妻子也能说出这般话来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would my wife could voice such simple wisdom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.75,0:34:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了那些行李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I saw the gathering of trunks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.01,0:34:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,她跟随您一同去吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She goes with you?{\r}
