Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.86,0:35:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但我在她身上找不到安慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I would find no comfort in her presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.20,0:35:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,而你可以给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I would in yours...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.18,0:35:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真的可以吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is such a thing possible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.51,0:35:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我只能让你住在侍从营地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will be forced to place you within followers' camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.68,0:35:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但这是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But yes, it is possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.62,0:35:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你也愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you so desire it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.18,0:35:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,愿意 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Dominus.{\r}
