Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.95,0:36:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,没时间了 他到底搞定了没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no more time. What did it come of him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.82,0:36:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,想搞清楚只有一个办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is one way to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.68,0:36:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们便去搞清楚吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us see it done or wrong.{\r}
