Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.48,0:37:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的城门还关得那么死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet fucking gate stands firmly rooted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.11,0:37:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他们肯定能打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They will see it raised.{\r}
