Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.25,0:37:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,行动 跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move, come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.16,0:37:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,把城门看紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See gate protected!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.65,0:37:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你去打开库房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You, open the storeroom!{\r}
