Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.89,0:38:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 埃提斯 - 发警报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Attius! - Raise the alarm{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.37,0:38:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,去喊人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Call for more men!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.23,0:38:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,躲起来 完事了我去找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hide yourself, I will find you when it is over!{\r}
