Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.04,0:40:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,洛厄斯呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is Laurus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.33,0:40:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里 奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am here, slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.26,0:41:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要背叛主人 参加叛军吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would turn against your dominus and join rebellion?{\r}
