Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.17,0:41:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,迪欧特莫斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Diotimus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.27,0:41:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,宅子已拿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The villa is taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.88,0:41:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你们快解开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See yourselves free.{\r}
