Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.67,0:42:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,趁他们还没有封锁退路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if they have not already sealed escape.{\r}
