Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.27,0:42:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.88,0:42:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是他本人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I stand the man himself.{\r}
