Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.71,0:43:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,出国多年怎么让你养成这种怪癖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Years abroad led you to strange pleasures,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.31,0:43:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,倒是很符合你野蛮的形象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}worthy of the beast you appear.{\r}
