Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.37,0:45:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,也屁用没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor fucking use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.18,0:45:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,如果换成我们求饶 他们会开恩吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would they show mercy if we were beneath heel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.92,0:45:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,别动 混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Still, cunt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.06,0:45:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.44,0:45:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,市政官把自己关在粮仓里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Aedile bars himself in the horreum,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.43,0:45:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,泼满了沥青 还扬言要点燃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}spilling pitch and threatens to put light to bear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.86,0:45:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.23,0:46:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不帮你们这些畜生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not lend aid to you and your animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.50,0:46:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,如果粮食都被烧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If grain is put to fire,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.00,0:46:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,连我都没办法管住那些"畜生"了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}even I will not have voice to calm my "Animals."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.65,0:46:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will do this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.94,0:46:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不然那些幸存的人绝对没有活路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or see your people that yet live fall from this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.56,0:46:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 饶命 - 别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Please. - Stay still!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.77,0:46:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你们休想得到这座城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will not have my city's heart!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.54,0:46:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.92,0:46:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他们 操翻罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill them! Fuck the Roman man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.95,0:46:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,谁敢走近 我就丢火把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make attempt on gate and I will for all to torch,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.07,0:47:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you fucking cunts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.36,0:47:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以解决他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can take him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.07,0:47:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力冈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Agron!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.26,0:47:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,放下矛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lower spear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.01,0:47:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,莱塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Laeta...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.39,0:47:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,全部杀光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill them all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.50,0:47:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.79,0:47:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,祈祷他能听你的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And pray your words hold meaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.63,0:47:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,别听他的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't listen to his words!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.59,0:47:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他让我们受苦的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's the reason we suffered!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.51,0:47:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought you dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.43,0:47:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你把我们的命运交到她手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would place our fate in her fucking hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.17,0:47:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我自有主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I place it in what I believe in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.83,0:47:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我活着 还有一些人活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I yet live, among a clutch of others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.47,0:47:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How many?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.32,0:47:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,很少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Too few.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.97,0:47:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不住手 活着的就更少了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And we will be fewer still, if you do not stop this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.13,0:47:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们辛苦挣来的一切就拱手相让吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would give them all we have worked for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.02,0:47:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,今夜我看了太多流血死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would see no more death this night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.68,0:47:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,打开门 让我们看到明天的太阳升起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Open gate, let us see sun crest upon another day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.06,0:47:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不向奴隶低头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not bow to fucking slaves!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.08,0:48:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,别老想着他们 想想你的人民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Turn thought from them, and towards your people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.97,0:48:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是不住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you do this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.94,0:48:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,黄泉之下你如何向他们交代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you will condemn them all to the afterlife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.62,0:48:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,包括我在内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your wife among them...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.47,0:48:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.85,0:48:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他会开门的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He would have opened the gate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.44,0:48:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他一定会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know he would of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.94,0:48:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他会为了我打开门的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He would have opened the gate for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.31,0:48:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能押在他身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I could not place faith in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.36,0:48:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚我们杀够了 也报了仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have had our fill of blood and vengeance this night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.85,0:49:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不要再残害幸存的罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No Roman that yet draws breath shall suffer further harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.34,0:49:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这座城是我们的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The city is ours!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.29,0:49:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们自由了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The city is free!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.71,0:49:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马人又一次失败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Once again the Romans fall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.59,0:49:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Victory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.33,0:49:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,看到心爱的人死去是难以承受的痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To see one loved robbed of life is a heavy thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.68,0:49:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,但罗马人不止一次这样伤害我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One done lightly by Romans many times to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.44,0:49:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,也许无法安慰你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is no balm,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.31,0:49:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但请记住 你所有的痛都压在我的肩上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but know that I carry the full weight of your loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.77,0:49:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,把她锁起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Place her in chains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.66,0:49:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,有战争就会有牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}War often carries with it great sacrifice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.82,0:49:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没有什么比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}None more keenly felt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.79,0:49:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,至爱的亲人离开这个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than threat of those one holds closest to heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.60,0:49:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,更让人难过的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}struck from this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.05,0:50:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要我的儿子落到这样的结局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have my son fall to such a fate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.60,0:50:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,在他还不能胜任指挥官的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because he was not ready for command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.62,0:50:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不能拒绝给他机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor would I deny him opportunity,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.10,0:50:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,让他向父亲证明自己长大成人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to prove himself a man in his father's eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.00,0:50:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你代我行使权力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You stand as my word and my will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.21,0:50:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,受您重托 父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You honor me, father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.89,0:50:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝对不辱克拉苏家族之名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I shall honor the name of Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.81,0:50:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,跟恺撒同行 带上你挑选的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ride with Caesar and men of your choosing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.74,0:50:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,去找莫姆缪斯以及科西尼斯的残军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seek out Mummius and what remains of Cossinius' legion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.36,0:50:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,找到斯巴达克斯 汇报他的动向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Find Spartacus and send word of his movement,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.93,0:50:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但不要打草惊蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but do not tempt engagement{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.75,0:50:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,等我带主力部队到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until I have arrived with proper force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.98,0:50:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你信誓旦旦 说得天花乱坠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You fill the air with lofty promise,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.25,0:51:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就是为了让我听命于一个小毛孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}only to command I bow to a fucking boy?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.64,0:51:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is my son!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.67,0:51:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你既然尊重我 也应该尊重他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And shall be treated with mirrored respect!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.91,0:51:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我为你担任军事保民官一职花了不少钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have spread coin towards your election as Military Tribune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.60,0:51:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,提比略还太年轻 不足冠以正式头衔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Formal title Tiberius is yet too young to hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.41,0:51:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,带上我的徽章 你可以自由出入军营\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wear my token to pass unmolested through encampment,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.50,0:51:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,直到显露你的真实身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until appearance is shorn to Roman likeness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.96,0:51:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我更喜欢那把剑和期望的职位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would prefer fancy sword and expected position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.04,0:51:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,按我指给你的路走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay upon path I have set,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.91,0:51:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,路到尽头 你自然荣耀加身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and see greater glories bestowed at journey's end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.01,0:51:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,吹响号角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sound horn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.55,0:52:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们往南征讨斯巴达克斯叛军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We advance south on Spartacus and those who follow him in rebellion!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.07,0:52:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,让倒向叛军的乱臣贼子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let our shadow fall upon them...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.26,0:52:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不分男女老幼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and every man, woman, and child{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.21,0:52:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,在罗马的荣光与威力之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so touched by it struck from this world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.66,0:52:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,死无葬身之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by the might and glory of Rome!{\r}
